+    """POST a payload to a subscriber endpoint, retrying transient failures.
+
+    Each attempt has a REQUEST_TIMEOUT-second timeout. Connection errors, timeouts and 5xx
+    responses are retried up to MAX_RETRIES times with exponential backoff; other responses,
+    including 4xx, are final. Every attempt is recorded on the returned result.
